Mystic Builder - fan-made Dauntless build planner

The build id encoding/decoding code in src/game/build-id.ts, src/game/build-model.ts
and src/game/upgrade-build.ts is ported from dauntless-builder-reforged
(https://github.com/atomicptr/dauntless-builder-reforged) and therefore licensed
under AGPL-3.0. The rest of the project is provided as-is for the community.

Dauntless and all related assets are property of Phoenix Labs.
This is an unofficial fan project not affiliated with or endorsed by Phoenix Labs.
